OL,3,GNEWSAWarning over water leak's impact
OL,4,Aon forest river
OL,5,
OL,6,FA large water leak in the New Forest
OL,7,Fcould have a "severe" impact on
OL,8,Fsensitive habitats, conservationists
OL,9,Fhave warned.
OL,11,FA burst main near the A35 outside
OL,12,FLyndhurst on Wednesday sent tens of
OL,13,Fthousands of litres of chlorinated
OL,14,Fwater into the headwaters of the
OL,15,FBeaulieu River.
OL,17,FProf Russell Wynn, of the New Forest
OL,18,FBiodiversity Forum, said the ecological
OL,19,Fimpact of mains water entering the
OL,20,Friver could be "just as bad" as
OL,21,Funtreated water.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
